    "Clean up %@?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "清理 %@？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Colon-separated, like PATH — checked before Homebrew and the rest. For mise: ~/.local/share/mise/shims. For Nix (Home Manager): /etc/profiles/per-user/<you>/home-path/bin.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "与 PATH 一样使用冒号分隔，优先于 Homebrew 等路径检查。mise 路径：~/.local/share/mise/shims。Nix（Home Manager）路径：/etc/profiles/per-user/<you>/home-path/bin。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Command": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "命令"
          }
        }
