        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启用扩展？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每隔%@刷新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything Raycast has built is already here. Import one again to update it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Raycast 已构建的扩展都已导入；再次导入可进行更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Extension menu": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "扩展菜单"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Extensions are disabled — enable them in Settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "扩展已停用，请在设置中启用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Extensions are disabled.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "扩展已停用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Extensions are third-party JavaScript, run on this Mac. A running command holds a JavaScript engine in memory until you leave it — expect Tinycast to use noticeably more RAM while one is open.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "扩展是会在此 Mac 上运行的第三方 JavaScript。命令运行期间会一直占用 JavaScript 引擎，因此打开扩展时 Tinycast 会使用更多内存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "File": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文件"
          }
        }
      }
